<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "Take_It.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\服屋.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"Hey, hey, look at this!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Hm? Shabetter?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yeah, yeah, somebody posted this on Shabetter."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Um... 
{PAUSE ""}
'<STYLE ID="1">Genius girl Erina Goto</STYLE>, at Zahha with a suspicious person.'"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"This is bad news, right?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Isn't he a brother or a relative or something?"<PG>
{PLAYSND "リファレンス専用\シャベッター.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
"Oh! A new one! With a picture!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Whoa, this guy is totally breaking out in a cold sweat. 
{PAUSE ""}
His face is damn good-looking, but the look in his eyes is sketchy... 
{PAUSE ""}
It's so bad even 'only if he's hot' doesn't apply."<PG>
"You can't see the face of the one with him, but from the silhouette it's definitely the <STYLE ID="1">genius girl</STYLE>."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Hey, the <STYLE ID="1">genius girl</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="2">Niimura</STYLE> know each other, right? Should we tell her?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yeah, I think this is seriously bad news."
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
